        [
          "4. Common Interview Questions"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-8007-b0f9-f027bf1379ab",
      "type": "numbered_list",
      "richText": [
        [
          "What are the main HTTP methods, and what do they do?"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-8031-b54b-d8da0e82f976",
      "type": "numbered_list",
      "richText": [
        [
          "What is the difference between "
        ],
        [
          "@GetMapping",
          [
            [
              "c"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          " and "
        ],
        [
          "@PostMapping",
          [
            [
              "c"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "?"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-80ce-8895-c912629ab728",
      "type": "numbered_list",
      "richText": [
        [
          "Why is POST not idempotent, but PUT and DELETE are?"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
