    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-807f-af00-e9a6fa5fc552",
      "type": "header",
      "richText": [
        [
          "5. Best Practices & Pitfalls"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-8040-adee-eb507d760cb5",
      "type": "text",
      "richText": [
        [
          "Best Practices:",
          [
            [
              "b"
            ]
          ]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-8005-9104-ef2e7915d2f2",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "richText": [
        [
          "Use appropriate HTTP methods semantically (e.g., don’t use GET to delete data)."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-803b-adb5-efcabaac4cbb",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "richText": [
        [
          "Keep APIs RESTful — the method name should reflect the action clearly."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-8093-a099-c8cebfbedf25",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "richText": [
        [
          "Use path variables for resource identifiers ("
        ],
        [
          "/users/{id}",
          [
            [
              "c"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          ") and request body or params for data."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-80fd-aa68-d68873420eaa",
      "type": "text",
      "richText": [
        [
          "Pitfalls to Avoid:",
          [
            [
              "b"
            ]
          ]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-8067-8b58-c966128b09c6",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "richText": [
        [
          "Misusing HTTP methods, e.g., using POST for operations that should be GET or PUT."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-80e8-a6ef-c4e07b7c992e",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "richText": [
        [
          "Not handling cases when a resource isn’t found, leading to unclear responses."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-80af-8d0e-ce712a915cf4",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "richText": [
        [
          "Ignoring idempotency implications, which can cause unexpected results in clients or caching."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
